Package: parallelPSO
Type: Package
Title: Parallel Particle Swarm Optimization
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Erick Chatalov
Maintainer: Erick Chatalov <chataloverick@gmail.com>
Description: Particle Swarm Optimization (PSO) algorithm with support for parallel
    processing using doParallel. Users can easily define their own objective
    function depending on the problem at hand. PSO can be run sequentially or
    in parallel, making it suitable for computationally intensive fitness
    functions and long simulations.
